{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANCHOR'S LAMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a multiplayer roguelike strategy game, where you as your own captain travel the thousands seas to find glory! On your way you gather a crew of exotic animals and creatures that will help you fight other captain's that stand in your way. In this world, all life is sentient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/792056dcb7ab51063450eb5378565a59.webp?t=1774342385\" width=614 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.poster.avif?t=1774342385\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.webm?t=1774342385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.mp4?t=1774342385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Nautical Units and place them in a 2x4 grid!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position units with multiple unique abilities to synergies and trigger each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip them with items!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant Grid slots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against real players asynchronically! No wait queues only domination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/dc502c53cfafabb27225e80abed09344.webp?t=1774342385\" width=614 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/30f8363c482362f342cb313b1b6c2f29.webp?t=1774342385\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/30f8363c482362f342cb313b1b6c2f29.poster.avif?t=1774342385\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/a9640a65199d7b341ee1aa657725fc69.webp?t=1774342385\" width=614 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is that every other month we release a new season with new units, new events and new mechanics. Each new season will drastically change the gameplay. But as the old season rotates out, don't worry, you can still play it in our CHAOS MODE, where any player may choose any season to play against other players with the same rules. Everyone can keep playing their favorite builds for ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/4b22bfc56e6c04b2e0929d22dfa8067f.webp?t=1774342385\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/4b22bfc56e6c04b2e0929d22dfa8067f.poster.avif?t=1774342385\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRING YOUR GAME EVERYWHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game on your computer or phone! Data will carry over as well as any collected items!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is free! you can buy 